y, letting you concentrate on staying alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons: Each run allows you to get a unique combination of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits: Earn credits and permanently unlock new upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Enjoy the multitude of enemies each with their own AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes of intense gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals and music straight from the 80s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicious gameplay!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489010/extras/0c668a34ace6b98edd76779e92ad9dab.poster.avif?t=1728560920\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489010/extras/0c668a34ace6b98edd76779e92ad9dab.webm?t=1728560920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489010/extras/0c668a34ace6b98edd76779e92ad9dab.mp4?t=1728560920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometry Survivor is the ultimate survival game, do not miss it!!</p>", "short_description": "Geometry Survivor is rogue-lite survival where you fight waves of enemies. Unlock innovative upgrades in the shop, acquire new ships and conquer the unforgiving grid world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489010/header.jpg?t=1728560920", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17285609